#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0085 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable is present with the same name as a variable present in ADSL but the variables do not have identical labels
#note "No ADSL in the study: $adsl_label has no value, the not empty($adsl_label) gate folds false, and the rule cannot fire. Pins the absent-ADSL disposition of the cross-dataset probe (declared operation EmptyResult.MISSING == inlined var_label accessor on a missing dataset)."
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AGE type=Num label="Age in Years"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 63
---
